<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Galate</para>
  <para style="toc1">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi É Teʋeni Galate Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galate</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="mt2">Pɔle Ná-Sɛʋɛi <optbreak/> É Teʋeni</para>
  <para style="mt1">Galate Nuiti Ma</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔle ɠa é Galate nuiti ta-zɛʋɛi ɠɛa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1">1:1</ref></char>). Sɛʋɛ ɠɛni de nii Pɔle teʋeni Egilisiiti ma, niiti ti ɠɛni Galate yooi zu, é zo kona ʋuunaanigɔ maazu lɔsaʋa ɠɛɠala ma, é li puulɔɔlugɔ maazu lɔfelai ma (48-57), Kilista zɔlɔɔga ʋoluma. Galate nuiti ti ɠɛni ga nui niiti ti ɠɛni zeini Galate yooi zu, Wɔlɔme masa zooi zu. Faaɠwɛ nu wolaiti ti la kwɛɛ, ʋɛ Pɔle ɠɛni ná, é ɗa sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛ, kɛlɛ toɠa zoo ɠɛɛzu ga Efɛze ɓaa Kolɛnte taa wola felegɔi naati gila.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔle sɛʋɛi ɠɛɛʋɛ é ɓɔɛ keletiɛinti pɔ, Zuifuiti ta niiti ti la ga Zuifua, ti Egilisiiti su Galate yooi zu. É sɛʋɛi nii ɠɛɛʋɛ seɠezeɠe, nii a kɛ é zɛɛ ɠalagi naa zakpe, nii nuiti ti ɠɛni bosu ga kɛni keletiɛinti ti ɠolo Zuifuiti ta-lɔgiti bɛ, ti Minazeɠe Pɔlɔmai zu, ma un ge daa ma mɛɛ ga tatipɛlɛʋolu vaa. Kpɔgi ta ɠɛni keletiɛinti saama, ti laasei pɛai ga Zuda Ɠala Pele Ziɛ Nuiti, naati ka ti ɠɛni kɛni keletiɛinti ti la ga Zuifua, ti lati pɛlɛʋolu. Ti inɛinɛgi lɔɔni ɓalaa Pɔle ná-keela vai ma zobogi vai zu. Pɔle ná-zobogi maaloboni, é ná-wɔlɔwɔlɔ vai ta zuɠula ti ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:11-2:14">1:11—2:14</ref></char>), ta é Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ɓalaa maaloboni, é ɠɛ ma, kizogi la zɔlɔɔga pele un kili nɔpɛ ma, kɛni kidaaleʋei nɔ maaʋele Yesu Kilista ma (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">2:16</ref></char>). Naama ka ga GALA ná-nuɓɔɠɔlai ma ɠulanumai, kɛlɛ nuiti ta-ɠɛɛwotiiti maaʋele laade.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeiʋɛ ga é Egilisiiti tuʋɔ, niiti ti Galate yooi zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:1-5">1:1-5</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Naa ʋoluma Pɔle ná-eteai zu vai tanigaa zuɠulani, nii a kɛ é ná-zobogi maalobo, nii é zea ga é kalagi wo, ta é dɛɛ ga é suɠɔɠɔni ga é ziɛ é zoloo tɔgi ma, kɛlɛ naa la ɠɛni zolooni (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 1:6-2:21">1:6—2:21</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. É zɛba é dama kpɛ é tɔgi ta zaalai ti-losuʋɛti suɠula ga pagɔ, é lo kizogi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 3:1-4:31">3:1—4:31</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Naa ʋolu, é kalagiti fe, ʋelei keletiɛn ʋelei maanɛai la ga nu siɛ sɔledai zu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 5:1-6:10">5:1—6:10</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Pɔle ná-sɛʋɛi ɠaaɓelagɛ ga tuʋɔgiti, ta é toli gaaɓela bo ga nu ɠizɛ su ga ni GALA ka nu maavalibona, é è ɠɛ nu niinɛ, naa vizɔgɛ, é leʋe tɔgi ma leveiti ba ti kɛlɛmaʋɛ, eɠɛʋelei nu lati fai la pɛlɛʋolu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GAL 6:11-18">6:11-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Tuʋɔ gooiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Nɛ̀i gè ga Pɔle, nà wo luʋɔsu. Nà ga Yesu Kilista ná-keelai. Gè la naama zobogi zɔlɔɔni nuɓusɛa ya, ɓaa nu ɠila zea, kɛni Yesu Kilista, ta Ɠɛɛɠɛ GALA nii é buzeɠeni, é kula saai ya. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Kɛɛleaiti pɛ ti ʋɛ, ti ɓɔ bà, gá wo luʋɔsu, wɔi wo Egilisiiti su Galate yooi zu.<verse eid="GAL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Ade-Ɠɛɛ GALA ta Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ti zaalai la wo ma, ti ziilɛigi ve wo ʋɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Kilista ɠa é ɓɔɠɔ veeni, tɔ ɓɔɠɔi, é de ɠizo da-ɠotoiti ma, naa ɠa a kɛ é de ɠula niima yeeɠɛɠala ɲɔi ya, eɠɛʋelei GALA ziimai la, é ga ade-Ɠɛɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Lɛbiyai ɠɛ GALA bɛ, eyɛsu ɠɔ! Amina!<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔ ɠila kpegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Dàavɔɔʋɛ gola, ga wo ɠɛlɛa GALA ba fala, nii é wo lolini Kilista ná-zaalai zaɓui zu, wo ɠaaʋote woo niinɛ ʋagɔi taɠili ma. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Gaamazu, woo niinɛ ʋagɔ ɠili ge la ná! Kɛlɛ nuiti ka ti wo ɓɔlɔzu, ta pɔ ti Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi maavalibo, é ʋilɛ Kilista ʋa. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Kɛlɛ anɛɛ giya ɓɔɠɔi ʋe, ɓaa geezuɠeelai seɠeai geeɠɔlɔgi zu, gá woo niinɛ ʋagɔ ɠili daazeelina wo ma, é ɠula zɔi ʋolu gi daazeelini wo ma, naama nui voovo! <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Ʋelei gi boni la mɔunpa, zenɔ ɠana gè bosu la ʋolu mɔnɔ: Ni nu nɔpɛ ka woo niinɛ ʋagɔ ɠili daazeelina wo ma, é ɠula zɔi ʋolu wo sɔlɔɔni, naama nui voovo!<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Nuɓusɛi yiima vai ɠa gè gaiziɛzu ɓaa, ɓaa GALA ziima vai? Nà ɠaaɓaazu ga gè nɛɛ nuiti bɛ ɓaa? Ni gè ɠɛni ɠaaɓaazu ga gè nɛɛ nuiti bɛ, gè la ɓena ɠɛ ga Kilista ná-botiɠɛ nu.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ɠɛɛ ʋelei ga keelai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà bosu wo ma ga: Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi gè daazeeliai, nuɓusɛ ná-faa ɓɛtɛa laade. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nà ɓɔɠɔi, gè la sɔlɔɔni nu ya, nu la kàlani da, kɛlɛ Yesu Kilista ɠa é kulani kɛlɛma bɛ̀.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>Wo màawoo mɛnini, ʋelei tùʋa ʋelei ɠɛni la mɔungi Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA fali vai zu. Gè GALA ná-Egilisii wɔinzeɠeni názu ga gola. Gè ɠaaɓaani ga gè koloɠolo. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Zuifuiti ta-ƓALA pele ziɛi zu, gè leʋeni Zuifui ma mɔinmɔin ba, ti ga kɛ̀ɠalaiti, mazɔlɔɔ sɛ̀bɛzeɠeni gola mɛ̀mɛwolani ta-vaa wɔlɔmaiti su.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Gè yɛni dèe ɠoozu, GALA ge yiimazeɠe ga ze, é tòli ga ná-zaalai maaʋele, ga gè botii ɠɛ bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>Siɛgi zu é nɛɛni bɛ la, é ná-Doun Zunui ɠulani kɛlɛma bɛ̀, ga gè ná-fai laazeeli zii ɠiligiti ma. Gè la ɠɛni liini nu nɔpɛ pɔ, a ʋa tɛ̀nɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>Gè la ɠɛni liini Zeluzalɛme, keelaiti pɔ bɛ, niiti ti ɠɛni nɔ̀un tuɠɔ, kɛlɛ gè sakpani nɔ Alaɓe yooi zu, naa ʋolu gè ɠale ma Damase.<verse eid="GAL 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Kona saʋagɔ ʋoluma, gè liini Zeluzalɛme, ga gi ɓɔɠɔ ɠwɛɛ gá Piyɛlɛ, gi folo puugɔ maazu lɔɔlugɔ (15) ɠɛɛni ada ɠila. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Kɛlɛ gè la ɠɛni keelai zɔi tanɔpɛ kaani ná, kɛni Zake nɔ, Maliɠii deɠei. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Fai niiti gè ti zɛʋɛzu, gè ɗa bo wo ma, GALA gaazu, gè la zɛɛ wosu ɲɛgɛlɛin.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Naa ʋolu gè liini Siili yooi zu ta Silisi yooi zu. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Naama ziɛgi pɛ su, Kilista ná-Egilisii zu nuiti ti ɠɛni Zudé yooi zu, ti la ɠɛni dɛ ɠaazulaani mà, ti ʋa kwɛ̀ɛ. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Kɛlɛ ti mɛnini ga: «Zɔi é ɠɛni ade wɔinzeɠezu mɔungi, toɠa na kidaaleʋei ma vai laazeeli, nii é ɠɛni pɔ é koloɠolo mɔungi zu.» <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Ti ɠɛni GALA dɛbizu nà-faa zu.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta zɔɔma ɠeelaiti <optbreak/> ti ɠomi fai Zeluzalɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Kona puugɔ maazu naanigɔ (14) leʋegai ma, Ɓalanaɓase ʋilɛni pòlu, gi li mɔnɔ Zeluzalɛme. Gè Tite ɓalaa seɠeni, é ʋilɛ gi ʋolu. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Gè niima ziɛi woni, ga gè ɠolo kulakɛlɛmai naa ʋɛ gè kaani. Gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi yɔɠɔzulɛɛni ga niiti ti levezu ga kundiɠiiti yɛ gaalɛbai zu, nii gè daazeelizu zii ɠiligiti saama, naa ɠa a kɛ nà-kpizɛi gè bogai, ɓaa gè ʋaazu bosu, é mina ɠɛ ga wafuun. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Tite é ɠɛni ga nà-siɛpolui, Gɛlɛki nu ɠɛni de, kɛlɛ é la ɠɛni laani zea ga maaɓaa vaa, ga kɛni é lati pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Anɛɛ naa ʋe, zɛɛ ɠɛɛɠɛlointi maaʋele ma, ti lɔai dɔɔɠuzu gi yeemazu, ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti tati pɛlɛʋolu. Ti lɔɔni gi zaama eɠɛ nɛnɛgiti, ti gá-ɓɔɠɔyeemai ʋɛtɛ gi su, gá-ɠilibalai zu gá Yesu Kilista, wɔin ɠɛni ti ma ga ti gi ɠɛ ga duɔiti. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Gi la ɠɛni woiloni ti-woo ma tago pa, naa ɠa a kɛ, Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma ɠaamai makɛ wo zaama.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Niiti ti levezu ga nu wolaiti, naati ti la ɠɛni zooni ti ʋa faa niinɛ nɔpɛ da nɔ̀un unma. Ti ɠɛʋelei la ɠɛni gàazu ga faa nɔpɛ, mazɔlɔɔ GALA ge la ɗa ga zeelɔzɔɠɔzu ɠɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Kɛlɛ tɔun ti kaani ga GALA ge Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeeli vai ɠalivaaʋɛ mà naati ma, niiti ti la ga Zuifua, eɠɛʋelei é daazeeli vai ɠalivaani la Piyɛlɛ ma Zuifuiti ma. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Mazɔlɔɔ GALA ka é kɛ̀ɛni ga keelai zii ɠiligiti bɛ, eɠɛʋelei é Piyɛlɛ ɠɛɛni la ga keelai Zuifuiti bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Zake, ta Piyɛlɛ, naa ʋɛɛ Zan ʋa, ti ɠɛni levezu ga kundiɠiiti, ti pɛtɛgai ma ga zaalai ɠa mà, ti yeelaani gi ya, gá Ɓalanaɓase, poogi ɠɛni ga naa ga ti yeezeiɗa gi wu. Naa ma, gi pɛ gi zolooni ma, ga gi li gi botii ɠɛ zii ɠiligiti saama, tiya ma, ti li Zuifuiti saama. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Ti ɠɛni gi ma nɔ: «À ɠizɛ bala nuiti su.» Gè ɠaaɓaaʋɛ, gè naa ɠɛ ga pagɔ.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ta Piyɛlɛ ta-zakpegi Antiyɔse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Siɛgi zu Piyɛlɛ ʋaani la Antiyɔse, gè sakpeni ɠaazuni ta ɠaazu, tɔɔzei peelala vaa ɠɛni de. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Tɔɔzei ta nuiti ti la ga Zuifua ti ɠɛni laamiizu ada ɠila, aisa Zuifui tanigaani ti ʋa ʋa, ti zeɠe Zake ʋɔ bɛ. Kɛlɛ naati paai ma, é zeɠeni zii ɠiligiti ba, é maaɠooza, tɔɔzei é ɠɛni luazu Zuifuiti ba niiti ti pɔ ga zii ɠiligiti ti lati pɛlɛʋolu. <verse eid="GAL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Zuifui zɔiti ti wooveledai ɠɛɛni ga tɔun kɛʋele, eyɛsu Ɓalanaɓase ɓalaagi ʋilɛ ti ʋolu ta-wooveledai zu. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Kɛlɛ siɛgi zu gè kaani la ga ti la ziɛzu ga pagɔ, eɠɛʋelei Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi ma ɠaamai la, gè ɠɛni Piyɛlɛ ma ti pɛ gaazu: «Ɗa ʋe, è ga Zuifui, è ɠɛa ziɛzu eɠɛʋelei zii ɠiligiti ti ziɛzu la, tɛi ti la ga Zuifu. Leeni vaa zu è zii ɠiligiti kpalazu ga kɛni ti ziɛ ga Zuifuiti kɛʋele?»<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Telebodai zɔlɔɔ fai <optbreak/> ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>Gɛi gi zɔlɔɔgai ga Zuifuiti, gi la zii ɠiligiti saama, niiti ti la ɠolozu GALA ná-tɔgi ʋɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>Gi kwɛni ga nui la ɗa ga ɠɛ ga telebo nu GALA gaazu, ga tɔgi zo fai maaʋele, kɛni kidaaleʋei maaʋele Yesu Kilista ma. Gá ɓalaagi gi ɠidaaleʋeni Yesu Kilista ma, naa ɠa a kɛ gi ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele Kilista ma. Tɔgi zo fai laade, mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛ nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga tɔgi zo fai maaʋele. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Kɛlɛ ni gá ɠaaɓaana ga gi ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti Kilista zaalai zu, a ʋɛtɛna ga gi ɠɛa ga kotoba nuiti ga zii ɠiligiti kɛʋele, naa ʋoluʋɛ ɠa mu ga Kilista ɠa é gi liizu kotoi ɠɛɛ vai ma ɓaa? Naa li poun! <verse eid="GAL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔgi zo fai niiti gè ɠɛlɛni ti ʋa, gè ti ɠoloɠolo, nà ɠɛna naati kpɛtɛa ʋolu, gè ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛa ga tɔ koloɠolo nui. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔgi zaɓui zu, gè la mɔ zɛnvui wosu tɔgi ʋɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ gè zɛnvui wo GALA bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>Gá Kilista gi ɓadɔni saa wului ma. Nà la mɔ de gè ʋa ɠɛ zɛnvui wosu, Kilista ɠa é yɛnvuzu sù. Zɛnvui gè bosu niina, nà bosu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele GALA Doun Zunui ma, nii é nɛ̀a ʋɛ, é yee zeɠe ɓɔɠɔ maazu nà-faa zu. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Gè la ɠɛlɛzu GALA ná-zaalai ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ ni telebodai ɠa zɔlɔɔ ga tɔgi maaʋele, Kilista zaani nɔ wafuun.<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi ɓaa kidaaleʋei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Ee, Galate nuiti, ɠimalala nuiti! Ɓɛ ɠa é wo unsuleʋeai, wɔiti Yesu Kilista ɓadɔ vai lɛai ga woye kpezekele saa wului ma? <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Nà pɔ wo niima vaa ɠila kpegi yɔɠɔzuʋɛ lɛ ga ze: Wo GALA Zɛnvui zɔlɔɔgɛ tɔɔzei wa tɔgi zosu ɓaa, ɓaa tɛi wo Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi mɛnigai ta wo la da? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Wa ga ɠimalala nu zɛbɛlɛ golaiti ɠana ɓaa? Wo tɔɔzeiɗa ga pagɔ ga GALA Zɛnvui maaʋele, wa pɔ wo gaaɓela ga wa ɓɔɠɔi wa-zobogi maaʋele ɓaa? <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Nii dɔin wo ziaa su, naa ɠɛa ga wafuun ɓaa? É la zooga ɠɛɛzu ga wafuun. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Siɛgi zu GALA ge ná-Zɛnvui veezu la wo ya, é ɗa laavɔɔ vaiti kɛ wo zaama, toɠa naa ɠɛɛzu tɔɔzei wa tɔgi zosu ɓaa, ɓaa tɛi wo Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi mɛnigai ta wo la da?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Abalaame laani GALA da, naa leveni bɛ ga telebodai.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Zen 15:6</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>À suɠwɛɛ deɠɛmu, ga zɔiti ti laai GALA da, naati ka ti ga Abalaame ná-dointi. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>GALA Sɛʋɛi kulaʋɛ kɛlɛma ma yeeluɠɔ ga zii ɠiligiti ta ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele. Naa ɠa é ba, é Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini Abalaame ma naa luɠɔ ga: «Zii kpein ka tuyai zɔlɔɔ è maaʋele ma.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:3">Zen 12:3</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Naa ma, zɔiti ti laai GALA da, tuya ɠa ti ʋɛ ta kidaaleʋe nui Abalaame.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Kɛlɛ zɔiti ti ʋoluzeizu tɔgi zo fai ʋa, naati ta kotoi laawu. Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Naama nui voovooʋɛ, zɔi é la naa pɛ soni, nii é tɔgi ma zɛʋɛi zu, é ʋa ziɛ la.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Zen 15:6</ref></char> bogɛ é zoloo Gɛlɛke woo zɛʋɛ wɔlɔmai ma.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Naa ɠoleʋɛ ga nu nɔpɛ ge la ɠɛa ga telebo nu GALA gaazu ga tɔgi zogai maaʋele, mazɔlɔɔ GALA Sɛʋɛi ɠɛ: «Zɔi telebogai GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Aɓk 2:4</ref></char>. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zɔi telebogai GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, naa ɠa zɛnvui wo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Tati pelei taɠili ɓalaa ka ga nii: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Telebo nui ɠa zɛnvui wo ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Kɛlɛ tɔgi la ɠilini kidaaleʋei ʋa. GALA Sɛʋɛi ɠɛ ma: «Zɔi a tɔ gooiti so, naa ɠa ziɛ ga tiye.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lev 18:5</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kilista foovooi zɔlɔɔni de-ʋotogi zu, é de unmɔɔ, é de ɠula tɔgi ná-foovooi laawu. Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga: «Foovoo nu ɠa ga naa, nii é zɛlɛni gului ʋa.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 21:23">TSV 21:23</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Naa ɠɛɛni, naa ɠa a kɛ, tuyai GALA ge ma minazeɠe boni Abalaame ʋɛ, naa ʋa ɠɛ ga zii ɠiligiti tɔnɔ, Yesu Kilista zaalai zu, ga de Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zɔlɔɔ ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele, nii GALA ge ma minazeɠegi woni.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɔgi ta minazeɠegi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà ɓɔɛzu é lo nuɓusɛiti ta-vai tanigaani ba: Siɛgi zu nui falima woo zɛʋɛi ɓɛtɛzu la ga pagɔ, nu nɔpɛ ge la zooga é ʋa su wooi naa ɠoloɠolo, ɓaa é ʋa ta la ma. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Tɔ ma, GALA ge minazeɠegiti boni Abalaame ʋɛ ta mavofodai. GALA Sɛʋɛi la ɠɛni ma: «mavofodaiti», eɠɛ ta ɠɛ ga nu mɔinmɔin, kɛlɛ eɠɛ gila kpe nɔ «è-mavofodai»,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Zen 12:7</ref></char>.</char></note> naa ɠa é ga Kilista. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Wɛlɛ nii gè pɔ gè bo, toɠa ga nii: GALA ge minazeɠegi ɓɛtɛni ga pagɔ. Tɔgi nii seiɗai kona unnaanigɔ kona ʋuusaʋagɔ (430) leʋegai ma, naa la zooga é ʋa GALA ná-minazeɠegi ɠoloɠolo, é ʋa gaaʋala ba. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni tɔgi ɠa nu ɠɛni pogani zɔlɔɔsu zea, naazu é la mɔ zɔlɔɔsu minazeɠegi ya. Tama, minazeɠegi maaʋele ɠa GALA ge ná-faanɛɛi ɠɛɛni la Abalaame ʋɛ.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Tɔgi zei ungi ɠa ga leeni mu? É zeini, nii a kɛ é naama vaiti dɛɛ, niiti ti la zolooni GALA ziimai ma, é yɛ ná eyɛsu Abalaame mavofodai ʋa, nii minazeɠegi woni ná-faa zu. Geezuɠeelaiti ka ti tɔgi naa veeni, zunu ɠila ge ɠɛ ga zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ nui. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Tama, zɔɠɔzuɓɛtɛ nui la ga nu ɠila nɔnɔ, kɛlɛ GALA ka ɠila nɔ.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Tɔgi ɠa GALA ná-minazeɠegiti daalɔɠɔma ɓaa? Naa li poun! Ni tɔ ge zeini, a zoo é zɛnvui ve nuɓusɛiti zea, naazu nuɓusɛi a la telebodai zɔlɔɔ GALA gaazu ga tɔgi zogai maaʋele. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Kɛlɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi ɠa bosu ga eteai pɛ ka kotoi yeezu, naa ɠa a kɛ, minazeɠegi ve ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele Yesu Kilista ma naati zea, niiti ti ɠidaaleʋeai. <verse eid="GAL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Aisa kidaaleʋei ʋa ʋa, tɔgi de zoni eɠɛ duɔiti, eyɛsu kidaaleʋei tɔna ɠula kɛlɛma. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Deɠɛmu, tɔgi ɠa zɛgai wɛlɛzu ade ma, eyɛsu Kilista ʋa, naa ɠa a kɛ de ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Tɛi niina kidaaleʋei ʋaa, de la mɔ gwɛlɛma nui yeezu.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Mazɔlɔɔ wo pɛ wo ɠɛa ga GALA dointi ga kidaaleʋei maaʋele Yesu Kilista ma. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Wo pɛ wo ɓatizegɛ ga wo ɠili Kilista ʋa, wo Kilista loa ɠɔba. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Zuifu vaa la ba, Gɛlɛki vaa la ba, duɔ vaa la ba, wɔɔlɔ vaa la ba, zunu vaa la ba, anzanu vaa la ba, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vaa la su, wo pɛ wa ga ani ɠila kpe nɔ, wa-ɠilibalai zu wa Yesu Kilista. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Ni wo ɠɛa ga Kilista nɔnɔiti, naazu wo ɠɛa ga Abalaame mavofodai, wa wɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ naa zu, nii GALA ge minazeɠeai la.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Tama, ni pogani zeɠe nui ɠa dɛ doungoyai zu, ta duɔi ta ga ɠɛʋele, anɛɛ ni tɔun ka é ga anii kpein maliɠii, <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>tɔ ɓɔɠɔi ɠa yɛ dɛ gwɛlɛma nuiti ta naavolo unda nuiti zeezu, eyɛsu kɛɛɠɛ ná-yeeɠɛɠala leveai zeeli. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Ada ɓalaagi, zenɔ ɠana é ɠɛni la, ade ɠɛai ma dɛ doungoyai zu, ade ɠɛni duɔlai zu zobogiti zeezu niiti ti zeini eteai nii unda. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Kɛlɛ yeeɠɛɠalai é leveni, naa zeeliai ma, GALA ge ná-Doun Zunui leʋeni, é zɔlɔɔ anzanui ta ʋa tɔgi wu, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>naa ɠa a kɛ, zɔiti ti tɔgi wu, é naati unmɔɔ, ta é ade ɠɛ ga GALA dointi.<verse eid="GAL 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Tɛi wo ga ná-dointi, GALA ge ná-Doun Zunui ná-Zɛnvui leʋegɛ, é zei ade-yiimaʋɛti, é ɗa wooɠula, é ɗa ɠɛ ma: «Aɓa!», naa ɠa ga «Kɛ̀ɛ!» <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Naa maaʋele ma, è la mɔ ga duɔ, kɛlɛ ɗa ga doin. Ni tama è ɠɛa ga doin, ɗa ɗɔnɔ zɔlɔɔ naa zu, nii GALA ge minazeɠeai la.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔle ná-ziizoolɛi Galate nuiti ta-vaa zu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Mɔungi, wo la ɠɛni GALA kwɛɛ, wo ɠɛni duɔlai zu naati zea, niiti ti la ga gala kitea. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Kɛlɛ niizu niina wo GALA kwɛɛga, é ɓudɛ naa maazu, GALA ge wo ɠwɛɛga ga ná-nuiti, lee vaa zu wo ɠalesu ma ʋolu eteai zu yɛnvuiti ma, zɛbɛ ta tosu la ti ʋa. Wa pɔ ga wo lɔ ʋolu naati ta-luɔlai zu ɓaa? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Wa fɛti voloiti sosu, ta alugi tanigaa, ta yeeɠɛɠalai tanigaa, naa ʋɛɛ konagi tanigaa ʋa! <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Ee! Nà luazu gola, ga botii kpein gè kɛa wa-vaa zu, naa mina ɠɛ zèa ga wafuun faa!<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, nà wo maanɛɛnɛzu, à ɠɛ ga kɛ̀ʋele, mazɔlɔɔ nà ɓalaagi nà ga wo ɠɛʋele. Wo la telebotala vaa nɔpɛ kɛɛni ga ze. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>Wo suɠwɛɛni ga, seeɓɛ vaa ɠa é kɛɛni, gè Woo Niinɛ Ʋagɔi laazeelini la wo ma, ma mɔungi zu. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Seeɓɛi é ɠɛni bà, naa ɠɛni wo ʋɛ ga ʋoluɠula vaa, wo la ɠɛni ɠɛɛni bà kpɛɛluu, wɔ̀in la zeɠeni wo ma. Tɔun, wo yeezeini bù eɠɛ GALA ná-geezuɠeelai, eɠɛ Yesu Kilista ɓɔɠɔi. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Wo wola ɠoozunɛɛni názu! Lee ɠa kɛai niina ga woye? Mazɔlɔɔ nà zeele wooi nii wosu wo ʋɛ, ga ni a la zoo ɠɛɛzu, wo ɓena wo-ɠaazuɠɛzɛiti kula su, wo ti ve bɛ̀. <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Gè ɠɛa niizu ga wo zili nui, tɛi gè gaamai wosu wo ma ɓaa?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Gilimai ti bosu ga woye, faa ʋagɔ laade. Ti wɔinni ti wo zeɠe bà, nii a kɛ wo ɠili ti ʋa. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Pagɛ ga wo ɠili faa ʋagɔi ɠɛɛ vai ʋa siɛnɔpɛ su, é la nɔ ga siɛgi zu gè ɠɛɛzu la wo zaama. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Dòinti, nà doun zɔlɔɔ koozuwanai zu ga niinɛ wa-vaa zu, eyɛsu wo ɠɛ ga nu ɠiteiti Kilista ná-faa zu. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Wɔin ɠa mà niizu, ga gè ɠɛ wo zaama, gè kpɔ̀ɛ wooi maavalibo, mazɔlɔɔ zìi ɠa zoolɛzu gola ga wa-vaa!<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Agaal ta Sala ti-ma ʋoogiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>À bo dɛɛ mà, wɔi wo wɔinni wo wa-eteai ziɛ tɔgi wu, wo la tɔgi wooi mɛnisu ɓaa? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga Abalaame doun zunu felegɔ zɔlɔɔni, gilagi ɠɛni ga duɔ anzanui nɔnɔi, gilagi ɠɛ ga anzanui é ga wɔɔlɔi, naa nɔnɔi. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Kɛlɛ duɔ anzanui ná-doun zunui zɔlɔɔni ga kpusɛi ná-faa ɓɛtɛai maaʋele, tama anzanui é ɠɛni ga wɔɔlɔi, naa ná-doun zunui zɔlɔɔni ga GALA ná-minazeɠegi ɓabii. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Niima vaiti ta ga faalaalii: Anzanu felegɔi niiti ta ga minazeɠe felegɔiti. Minazeɠegi gilagi, naa ɠa é ga Agaal, é ga Sinayi gizei nɔnɔi, é dointi sɔlɔɔsu, ti ga duɔiti. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Agaal ɠa ga Sinayi gizei, é Alaɓe yooi zu, naati ka ti ma ta Zeluzalɛme nii é ná niizu, tɔɔzei toɠa ga duɔi ta ná-dointi pɛ. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Kɛlɛ Zeluzalɛme é geezuʋɛ, toɠa ga wɔɔlɔi, tɔ ɠa é ga ade-lee. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Mazɔlɔɔ sɛʋɛʋɛ GALA Sɛʋɛi zu ga:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">«Ɠoozunɛ, ɗɛi è ga doun zɔlɔɔtala anzanui, è la doun zɔlɔɔsu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Ɠoozunɛ, è wooɠula la, ɗɛi è la doun ɠoozuwana wosu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">Mazɔlɔɔ anzanui kɛlɛi wogai ba, ná-dointi ta mɔin gola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="GAL 4:27">é leʋe anzanui nɔnɔi ʋa, nii é zini bɛ.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 54:1">Eza 54:1</ref></char>.</char></note><verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Wɔun, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, wo zɔlɔɔgɛ eɠɛʋelei Izaake zɔlɔɔni da, ga GALA ná-minazeɠegi ɓabii. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Kɛlɛ ʋelei nɔ zɔi é zɔlɔɔni ga kpusɛi ná-faa ɓɛtɛai maaʋele, é ɠɛni zɔi wɔinzeɠezu la, nii é zɔlɔɔni ga GALA Zɛnvui ná-faa ɓɛtɛai maaʋele, zenɔ ɠana é ɠɛɛzu la niizu. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Kɛlɛ lee ɠa GALA Sɛʋɛi bosu? «Duɔ anzanui ɓɛ ta ná-doun zunui, mazɔlɔɔ duɔ anzanui ná-doun zunuiti ti la ɓɔga poganii ma, ta wɔɔlɔ anzanui ná-doun zunui.»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 21:10">Zen 21:10</ref></char>.</char></note> <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Naa ɠa é ba, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ade la ga duɔ anzanui ná-dointi, da ga wɔɔlɔ anzanui ná-dointi.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">À mina ʋala wa-wɔɔlɔyai ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Kilista ade unmɔɔga, ga de ɠɛ ga wɔɔlɔ ɠiteɠitegiti. Deɠɛmu à lo kpaan wɔɔlɔyai naa zu. À dama, wo mina mɔ ɠale ma wo ʋa lɔ tɔgi zo fai ma luɔla ɠasɔi wu.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>À woilo! Nà Pɔle, nà bosu wo ma ga: Ni wa ɓɔɠɔ latina pɛlɛʋolu, Kilista la mɔ faa nɔpɛ paa wo ma názu. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Nà nii wosu, gè maaɓakpa mɔnɔ, zunu nɔpɛ é latisu pɛlɛʋolu, kɛni é Zuifuiti ta-lɔgi pɛ so, é ziɛ la. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Wɔi wo ɠaaɓaazu wo ɠɛ wo ɓɔɠɔ lɛ GALA gaazu ga telebo nu ga tɔgi zogai maaʋele, wo ɓɔɠɔ ɓeteʋea Kilista ʋa, wo ʋala GALA ná-zaalai ma. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Gɔnɔi, gá-ɠitogi ɠa ga gi ɠɛ ga telebo nuiti GALA gaazu, naa ɠa gi maaɓɔunsu ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-zɛbɛi maaʋele, é botii ɠɛɛzu ga gá-ɠidaaleʋei maaʋele. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ni nu ɠiliʋɛ Yesu Kilista ʋa, tatipɛlɛʋolui ɓaa tatipɛlɛʋolulalai, naa tanɔpɛ ge la ga faa ɓii. Nii é ga faa ɓiigi, naa ɠa é ga kidaaleʋei, é botii ɠɛɛzu ga nɛɛbɛi maaʋele.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Wo ɠɛni ɓizɛzu ga pagɔ! Ɓɛ ɠa é pele leʋeai wo luɠɔ, ga wo mina ɠolo gaamai ʋɛ? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>GALA nii é wo loligai, naa lɛi, niima unsu leʋe vai ʋa ɠula zea. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Eɠɛʋelei ta ɗa bo la ga: «Lɛʋɛi tago nɔ ɠa a ɗa ɓulu vukɔ ɠaayɔgai pɛ kpokolo.» <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Maliɠii naama ladalai veeʋɛ zèa wa-vaa zu ga wo la kisiɛ ɠili boga. Kɛlɛ zɔi é wo ɓɔlɔzu, é ɠɛni ga nui ma zii nɔpɛ, GALA ka yeeʋozɛ ba.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Nɔ̀un nà, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ni gaamazu gè ɠɛa dɛ tatipɛlɛʋolu vai laazeelizu, leeni vaa zu ta yɛ wɔ̀inzeɠezu nɔ ɠɔ? Naazu ma, wooi gè daazeelizu Kilista ná-faa zu, ga é ɓadɔni saa wului ma, naa la mɔ ɓena ɠɛ ga kɔɠɔziɠa zaɓu Zuifu nɔpɛ bɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Wɔin ɠa mà ga zɔiti ti wo ɓɔlɔzu, ti ɓɔɠɔ zɛɛɠa!<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Wɔun, kɛ̀ɛleaiti, GALA ge wo loligɛ ga wo ɠɛ ga wɔɔlɔiti. Kɛlɛ à mina wɔɔlɔyai naa ɠɛ ga zaɓui, wa ɠɛ eteai ziɛzu la ga kpusɛi yiimaiti. Kɛlɛ à ɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ ga botiɠɛ nui ɛsɛ pɛ bɛ ga nɛɛbɛi maaʋele. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɔgi pɛ daazeeliʋɛ woo ɠila kpe su: «È-zeiɲɔɠɔi nɛɛ ʋɛ, eɠɛ ɗa ɓɔɠɔi.» <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Kɛlɛ ni wa ɓɔɠɔ maawanazu wo ɠilagilagiti, wo ɗa ɓɔɠɔ ʋali ga wo ɠilagilagiti, à dama, wo mina ɓɔɠɔ ɠoloɠolo.<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Zɛnvui ta kotoba ɓusɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Wɛlɛ deɠɛmu, nii gè bosu wo ma: À va bu, GALA Zɛnvui lo wo luɠɔ wa-eteai zu, wo la ziaa ga kpusɛi yiimaiti naazu. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Mazɔlɔɔ nii é ga kpusɛi yiimai, naa la nɛɛni Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ʋɛ. Nii é ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yiimai, naa la nɛɛni kpusɛi ʋɛ. Ta ɓɔɠɔ laalɔɠɔma, naa ɠa a kɛ, nii wo wɔinni wo kɛ, wo la zooga wo ʋa naa ɠɛ. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Kɛlɛ ni Zɛnvu Ɲadegai a lona wo luɠɔ, wo la mɔ tɔgi ná-zobogi wu.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Tama kpusɛi ɠɛɛwotiiti kulaʋɛ kɛlɛma, tiya ɠa ti ga niiti: koloɠologi, kɔzɔba vai, ɓaaɠulama vai, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>kɔɔɠɔ gani kɔɔ vai, zoɠo vai, maayobalabɛ vai, kpɔɛ vai, tolo ɲɔi, ziiɠulagi, maaɠɔɔ fai, zeeɠaaɠwɛɛ vai, balima vaiti, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>gaazuɠulapɔi, dɔɔzodai, ziimaɠɛɛ lateʋegai, ta naa ɠɛɠala vaiti. Nà wo lɛnɛsu niina, eɠɛʋelei gè boni la wo ma, zɔiti ti naama vaiti kɛɛzu, ti la GALA ná-masadai zɔlɔɔga.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Kɛlɛ Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ma waai ɠa é ga niiti: nɛɛbɛi, koozunɛɛi, ziilɛigi, ziilɔɔi, nuɓɔɠɔlai, nuʋagɔlai, wooɠɛɠiladai, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>sɛsɛbogi, ɓɔɠɔzogi. Tɔ ge la niima vaiti daalɔɠɔma. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Zɔiti ti ga Yesu Kilista nɔnɔiti, naati ti ti-ɓusɛi ɓadɔa saa wului ma, naa ʋɛɛ ná-ɓɔɠɔyiimai ta ziima vai ʋa.<verse eid="GAL 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Ni ada zɛnvui wosu Zɛnvu Ɲadegai zaɓui zu, ade zɛ ná ɓalaa é lo ade-ziɛ ʋeleiti tuɠɔ. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>Ade mina ɠɛ ga waso nu, ade mina ɗa ga ɓɔɠɔ yiiɠaawana vaiti kɛ, ɓaa de ʋa ɗa toloi ɠula ga ɓɔɠɔ.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">À faanɛɛi ɠɛ nui pɛ bɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ni nui ta a zona faaɠaazagi ɠɛɛzuʋɛ, wɔiti GALA Zɛnvui wo ʋa, à pilɛ pele ʋagɔi ʋa, wo sɔle ga sɛsɛbogi. Dama ga ɓɔɠɔ, ɗa ɓalaagi è mina lɔ tɛgai zu. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>À ʋɛɛ ɓɔɠɔ ʋa wo ɠilagilagi pɛ, wo wa-ɠasɔ wuigiti seɠe, wa ɠolo ɠana Kilista ná-tɔgi ʋɛ. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Ni nui ta a ɠisiɛna ga toɠa ga nu ɓii, tama é la vɔlɔ ga ani nɔpɛ, naa ɠa ɓɔɠɔ yaavazu. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Ɛsɛ ge ɓɔɠɔ ziɛ ʋelei vɛɠɛlɛfɛɠɛlɛ. Ni toɠa zoo ɓɔɠɔ maamusɛzu, toɠa naa ɠɛ ɓɔɠɔ nɔ ʋɛ, anɛɛ é la ʋokɔɠɔni nu ɠili ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Mazɔlɔɔ ɛsɛ maanɛɛʋɛ é ɓɔɠɔ ɠasɔi zeɠe.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Nui ti kalasu ga GALA daawooi, naa maanɛɛʋɛ é ná-kalamɔin ɠɔ zeaɠɔligi kpein su.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>À mina ɓɔɠɔ yaava pa, mazɔlɔɔ nu la ɲɛɛɠulaa GALA su. Nii nui fazasu, naa ma lɔnɔgi ɠa a ɗa teʋe. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Zɔi é fazai wosu ga kpusɛi yiimai, kpusɛi ná-fai ma lɔnɔgi ɠa ve zea ga saai. Kɛlɛ zɔi é fazai wosu ga Zɛnvu Ɲadegai yiimai, Zɛnvu Ɲadegai ná-fai ma lɔnɔgi ɠa ve zea ga ɠɔoɠɔ zɛnvui. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Ade mina ɓɔlɔ ga faanɛɛ ɠɛɛ vai, mazɔlɔɔ da ʋaazu ma lɔnɔgi zɔlɔɔsu yeeɠɛɠala ʋagɔi zu é ʋaazu, ni de iɲɔ ge la ɠɛ leʋeni, de ʋa ɓɔlɔ. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Naa ɠa é ba, ni nɔ ma zobogi ɠa de ʋɛ, de ɗa faanɛɛi ɠɛ nɔ ɛsɛ pɛ bɛ, ma un ge daa ma ga naati, niiti ti ga de-ɠɛɛleaiti kidaaleʋei zu.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Woo ɠaaɓelagiti ta tuʋɔgiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>À wɛlɛ zèeʋogi ʋa, ʋelei sɛʋɛ ɠaei ɠaaɓaazagai la, nà ɓɔɠɔi, gè sɛʋɛai. <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Zɔiti kpein ti tatipɛlɛʋolu vai laazu wo unma ga kasɔ, naama nuiti ka ti wɔinni ti ɓɔɠɔ lɛ ga nu ʋagɔ nuɓusɛiti gaazu. Naama ungi ɠa ti ʋɛ ga faa ɠila kpe nɔ, nu mina ti wɔinzeɠe, é ʋa lo Kilista zaa vai ʋa saa wului ma. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Mazɔlɔɔ tɛiti ti tatipɛlɛʋolu vai ɠɛɛzu, ti la tɔgi zosu, kɛlɛ ta pɔ wo lati pɛlɛʋolu, ga ti ʋa ɗa waso ga woye, tɔɔzei ti poogi ʋɛa wo-ɓusɛi ʋa. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Kɛlɛ nɔ̀un nà, gè la ɓɔɠɔ lɛbia faa ɠili nɔpɛ su, kɛni ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista zaa wului nɔ, tɔun maaʋele ma eteai zaaʋɛ nɔ̀un tetemazu, nà ɓalaa gè za eteai letemazu. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Nu latini pɛlɛʋolu, ɓaa nu mina lati pɛlɛʋolu, naa la ga faa ɓii nɔpɛ, kɛlɛ kɛni è ɠɛ ga kpɛtɛani niinɛi. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Niiti kpein ta ziɛ ga kala gooi niiti, ziilɛigi ta maawɔinɠai ɠɛ ti ʋa, é ɠɛ ɓalaa GALA ná-nuɓusɛiti ba, Izilayɛle nuiti.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Eyɛsu pɛ, nu nɔpɛ ge mina mɔ kpɔ̀lɔ, mazɔlɔɔ nà ziɛzu ga pala ʋiliiti, gè ti zɔlɔɔni kɔ̀lɔgi ma Yesu ná-faa zu.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Kɛ̀ɛleaiti, ade-Maliɠii Yesu Kilista ná-zaalai yɛ wo ʋa! Amina!<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
